      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to call but it doesn't change the reality. even if i talk to someone, tomorrow is still gonna be the same. the same demands, the same crushing routine. it's not like something can just... change. i'm just stuck in this loop and there's no exit. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just drowning a little bit more every single day. i just feel so useless.",
